		P1:	Point{X: 3 * (c.P2.X - c.P1.X), Y: 3 * (c.P2.Y - c.P1.Y)},
		P2:	Point{X: 3 * (c.P3.X - c.P2.X), Y: 3 * (c.P3.Y - c.P2.Y)},
