	// Priority determines selection order (higher = preferred).
	// Standard priorities:
	//   - 100: GPU backends (Vulkan, Metal, D3D12)
	//   - 50: Hardware-accelerated software (WARP)
	//   - 10: Pure software backends
	Priority	int

